# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# log of an HFSS run that is still being written (kept with the run folder once it finishes)
Design*/simulation/results/*.log
# AEDT projects, solved results, field exports, CSV simulation data, and lock files: never tracked
*.aedt
*.aedtresults/
*.aedt.lock
*.aedt.*
*.fld
*.csv
# live AEDT project of each Design (one per Design, kept open); snapshots of it are kept in the run folders
Design*/simulation/aedt/
# AEDT autosave / temp files and the default "Project1" AEDT opens without a project
*.aedt.auto
*.aedt.temp
Project1.aedt
# crash dumps / local run logs
*.stackdump
Design*/layout_run.log
# archives
*.rar
# GitHub copy = code + parameters + records of the runs design.json uses (skill/parameter_provenance.md §7).
# Generated GDS are rebuilt by the layout code; run folders stay local except the records that
# code/general/sync_tracked_results.py force-tracks (run.json, summaries/, figures/, top-level json/md/txt/png).
Design*/gds/**/*.gds
Design*/results/*/*/
# dated wafer summary / delivery folders at the repository root (e.g. 20261115_latest, 20261116): local only;
# per-design figures are tracked in Design*/fig
/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*/
# superseded GDS/figure revisions kept locally only (current revisions are in gds/ and fig/)
Design*/gds/previous/
Design*/fig/previous/
# TiAu marker batch outputs (wafer GDS files exceed 100 MB): local only, see note/tiau_marker_alignment.md
/TiAu_batch/
# dated fabrication deliveries (large GDS): local only; Template/ and README stay tracked, see skill/fabrication_output.md
/Fabrication output/[0-9]*/
